        rdfs:comment                   "Pale brown linen almost entirely covered with large and small irregular flower forms with connecting stems, worked in herringbone stitch with pinkish red, pale brown, green white and a little blue and orange silk. Originally outlined with black silk, most of which has disappeared."@en ;
